    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"\"\npage-layout: full\ntoc: false\ndescription: \"Entertainment marketing case studies — campaign strategy, analytics, and brand storytelling.\"\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n---\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"page-header\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p class=\"section-label\">Portfolio</p>\n    <h1>Entertainment Marketing Projects</h1>\n    <p>Case studies, campaigns, and data-driven strategies across the entertainment industry</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"background:#FAFAF7;padding:4rem 0;\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row g-4\">\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <div class=\"proj-card\">\n          <div style=\"height:160px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0A1628,#1E3060);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.8rem;\">🎵</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Music Marketing</p>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#0A1628;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Streaming Platform Launch Campaign</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Multi-channel campaign strategy targeting Gen Z listeners for a regional music streaming platform launch, using social listening and survey data to map content across TikTok, Instagram, and Spotify.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#0A1628;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Key Results:</p>\n            <ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B7280;padding-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;\">\n              <li>Projected 40% brand awareness lift among target demo</li>\n              <li>Influencer plan reaching 500K+ combined followers</li>\n              <li>Full campaign brief, timeline, and budget breakdown</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div><span class=\"proj-tag\">Spotify</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Social Strategy</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Gen Z</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <div class=\"proj-card\">\n          <div style=\"height:160px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e,#3a0d45);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.8rem;\">🎬</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Film Marketing</p>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#0A1628;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Indie Film Release Strategy</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Low-budget digital marketing plan for an independent film using niche audience targeting and influencer micro-partnerships to maximize reach within a $10K budget.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#0A1628;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Key Results:</p>\n            <ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B7280;padding-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;\">\n              <li>Identified 3 high-intent audience micro-segments</li>\n              <li>Secured 5 micro-influencer partnerships (avg. 45K followers)</li>\n              <li>Full release timeline across theatrical + streaming windows</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div><span class=\"proj-tag\">Influencer</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Niche Audience</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">ROI</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <div class=\"proj-card\">\n          <div style=\"height:160px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0d2137,#0f5f7a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.8rem;\">🎪</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Live Events</p>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#0A1628;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Music Festival Social Media Audit</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Competitive social media audit of three major music festivals — analyzing posting cadence, content mix, engagement rates, and audience sentiment to deliver a revised engagement playbook.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#0A1628;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Key Results:</p>\n            <ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B7280;padding-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;\">\n              <li>Benchmarked 6 months of cross-platform content data</li>\n              <li>Identified top-performing content formats per platform</li>\n              <li>Delivered 12-page engagement playbook</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div><span class=\"proj-tag\">Social Audit</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Instagram</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">TikTok</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <div class=\"proj-card\">\n          <div style=\"height:160px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1c1a0d,#635a10);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.8rem;\">📊</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Analytics</p>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#0A1628;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Audience Segmentation Study</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Used survey data and behavioral analytics to identify three high-value streaming listener clusters, translated into personalized messaging frameworks for each segment.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#0A1628;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Key Results:</p>\n            <ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B7280;padding-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;\">\n              <li>Analyzed 200+ survey participants</li>\n              <li>Created Tableau dashboard of cluster behavior</li>\n              <li>3 custom messaging frameworks with sample creative</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div><span class=\"proj-tag\">Segmentation</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Tableau</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">R</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <div class=\"proj-card\">\n          <div style=\"height:160px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a0a0a,#7a1515);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.8rem;\">📱</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Brand Partnership</p>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#0A1628;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Artist × Brand Collab Proposal</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Co-branded pitch between an emerging R&B artist and a streetwear brand — audience overlap analysis, campaign concepts, projected KPIs, and a fully formatted stakeholder pitch deck.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#0A1628;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Key Results:</p>\n            <ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B7280;padding-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;\">\n              <li>Audience overlap analysis across 4 platforms</li>\n              <li>Projected 250K impressions from organic + paid push</li>\n              <li>Complete pitch deck with creative concepts</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div><span class=\"proj-tag\">Brand Deck</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">KPIs</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Partnership</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n        <div class=\"proj-card\">\n          <div style=\"height:160px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0a1e0a,#1a6b2a);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:2.8rem;\">🔍</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:1.5rem;\">\n            <p style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Market Research</p>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:#0A1628;margin-bottom:0.75rem;\">Podcast Audience Growth Report</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:#6B7280;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1rem;\">Analyzed podcast industry growth trends and listener demographics using Edison Research data to recommend a content and distribution roadmap for a campus entertainment podcast.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#0A1628;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0.4rem;\">Key Results:</p>\n            <ul style=\"font-size:0.8rem;color:#6B7280;padding-left:1.25rem;margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.8;\">\n              <li>Identified top 3 growth levers for indie podcasts</li>\n              <li>Benchmarked 10 comparable entertainment podcasts</li>\n              <li>6-month content and distribution calendar</li>\n            </ul>\n            <div><span class=\"proj-tag\">Research</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Podcasting</span><span class=\"proj-tag\">Trends</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n```\n",
